  "prefLabel": "Jus 2001.03 Autopsy report",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 2001.03 “Autopsy report” means a document prepared by the chief medical examiner, deputy chief medical examiner or designee after a postmortem examination of the deceased has been conducted, which details the findings made regarding the cause and manner of death after a postmortem examination of the deceased has been conducted.\n\nSource. #8937, eff 7-14-07",
